[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1441.59, "timestamp": "00:24:01", "text": "房间A，这是什么？呃，这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1450.35, "timestamp": "00:24:10", "text": "是的，终于轮到我自己跑了，这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1452.95, "timestamp": "00:24:12", "text": "重置相机厨师"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1456.19, "timestamp": "00:24:16", "text": "播放功能显示“播放所有内容”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1466.19, "timestamp": "00:24:26", "text": "是从 Twitch 上看到的，还是从其他地方看到的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1468.87, "timestamp": "00:24:28", "text": "Streamlabs，因为如果你去我的 Twitch 直播间的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1470.95, "timestamp": "00:24:30", "text": "如果你做任何频道，频道就对了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1484.19, "timestamp": "00:24:44", "text": "哦，Streamlabs"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1487.669, "timestamp": "00:24:47", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1490.59, "timestamp": "00:24:50", "text": "好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1496.89, "timestamp": "00:24:56", "text": "2004年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1499.99, "timestamp": "00:24:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]